      "body": "**Actionable comments posted: 7**\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧹 Nitpick comments (2)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>my-app/src/App.styles.ts (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`4-4`: _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**모바일 대응을 위해 viewport 단위 재검토를 권장합니다.**\n\nLine 4의 `height: 100vh`는 모바일 브라우저 주소창 변화 시 레이아웃 흔들림이 생길 수 있습니다. `min-height: 100dvh`(필요 시 fallback 병행)로 확인해보면 어떨까요?\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/App.styles.ts` at line 4, 파일 my-app/src/App.styles.ts에서 현재 사용 중인\n\"height: 100vh\" 규칙으로 인해 모바일 주소창 변화 시 레이아웃이 흔들릴 수 있으니, 해당 규칙을 \"min-height:\n100dvh\"로 대체하고 호환성을 위해 폴백으로 \"min-height: 100vh\" (또는 필요 시 기존 \"height: 100vh\")를\n순차적으로 선언하여 적용하세요; 즉, 찾을 식별자 \"height: 100vh\"를 교체하고 새로운 min-height 규칙을 해당 스타일\n블록(또는 관련 클래스/컴포넌트 스타일)에 추가하세요.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>my-app/src/components/cardPreview/CardPreview.tsx (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`24-24`: **`EachCardNumber` 함수를 JSX 문법으로 호출하세요.**\n\n현재 `EachCardNumber(number, index)`는 React 컴포넌트처럼 보이지만 일반 함수로 호출되고 있습니다. 이 패턴은 두 가지 문제를 야기합니다:\n\n- `key` prop을 전달할 수 없어 React의 리스트 렌더링 규약을 위반합니다\n- 컴포넌트와 헬퍼 함수의 의도가 모호해집니다\n\n함수 시그니처를 `key`, `number`, `index`를 받도록 수정하고 JSX 문법으로 호출하세요: `<EachCardNumber key={index} number={number} index={index} />`\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/components/cardPreview/CardPreview.tsx` at line 24, The map\ncurrently calls EachCardNumber as a plain function (cardNumber.map((number,\nindex) => EachCardNumber(number, index))) which prevents passing a React key and\nblurs component intent; change the map to JSX syntax: cardNumber.map((number,\nindex) => <EachCardNumber key={index} number={number} index={index} />) and\nupdate the EachCardNumber component/signature to accept props (e.g., function\nEachCardNumber({ number, index }) or a React.FC with props number and index) so\nit renders correctly as a component and receives number and index via props.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for all review comments with AI agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nInline comments:\nIn `@my-app/.eslintrc.cjs`:\n- Around line 1-10: Remove the unused legacy ESLint config file by deleting the\n.eslintrc.cjs that exports the module.exports object (the parser/plugins/extends\nblock shown) because it’s ignored when a flat eslint.config.js exists; remove\nthe file from the repo and commit the deletion, then verify no other .eslintrc.*\nfiles remain to avoid confusion.\n\nIn `@my-app/.gitignore`:\n- Around line 10-14: .gitignore에 .env 계열 파일이 누락되어 있어 민감 정보가 추적될 수 있습니다;\n.gitignore 파일을 열고 기본 패턴(.env)과 모든 확장자 버전(.env.*, 예: .env.local,\n.env.production)을 무시하도록 추가하고, 필요하다면 템플릿용 .env.example 같은 예외 패턴(!.env.example)을\n남겨 두어 환경변수 파일이 커밋되지 않도록 수정하세요.\n\nIn `@my-app/index.html`:\n- Line 2: 현재 문서의 <html> 요소가 lang=\"en\"으로 설정되어 있어 한국어 UI와 불일치합니다; index.html의\n<html> 태그에서 lang=\"en\"을 lang=\"ko\"로 변경해 문서 언어를 한국어로 맞추고 스크린리더 등 접근성 도구가 올바른 언어를\n사용하도록 수정하세요.\n\nIn `@my-app/package.json`:\n- Around line 24-31: The dependency `@storybook/test` is pinned to 8.6.15 while\nall other `@storybook/`* packages are 10.3.5; update package.json by either\nchanging the `@storybook/test` entry to \"^10.3.5\" to align major versions or\nremove the `@storybook/test` dependency entirely if it's unused (search for\nimports/usages of \"@storybook/test\" in the codebase first); after changing\npackage.json run your package manager install and run tests/build to verify\nnothing breaks.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/components/cardPreview/cardBrandImage/CardBrandImage.tsx`:\n- Around line 10-13: The checkMasterCard function only checks 51–55 and misses\nthe newer Mastercard BIN range 2221–2720; update checkMasterCard to parse both\nthe first two digits (Number(cardNumber.slice(0,2))) and the first four digits\n(Number(cardNumber.slice(0,4))) and return true if the two-digit value is\nbetween 51 and 55 OR the four-digit value is between 2221 and 2720, making sure\nto guard against empty/short cardNumber before slicing; reference\ncheckMasterCard and cardNumber when applying the change so EmptyImg no longer\nappears for valid Mastercard ranges.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/styles/reset.css`:\n- Around line 18-19: The CSS has conflicting declarations—keep only one of the\ntwo conflicting properties to satisfy stylelint: remove the redundant\n\"font-size: 100%\" declaration so \"font: inherit\" remains (it covers font-size\nvia the shorthand), i.e., delete the \"font-size: 100%\" line where the stylesheet\ncurrently sets both \"font-size\" and \"font: inherit\".\n\nIn `@my-app/src/utils/Validation.ts`:\n- Around line 10-13: isValidRange currently treats lengths greater than\nmaxLength as valid; update the function isValidRange to return true only when\nvalue.length is within 0 and maxLength inclusive (i.e. value.length >= 0 &&\nvalue.length <= maxLength) and return false otherwise; if the intended behaviour\nis to require an exact length instead, change the check to value.length ===\nmaxLength in the isValidRange implementation.\n\n---\n\nNitpick comments:\nIn `@my-app/src/App.styles.ts`:\n- Line 4: 파일 my-app/src/App.styles.ts에서 현재 사용 중인 \"height: 100vh\" 규칙으로 인해 모바일 주소창\n변화 시 레이아웃이 흔들릴 수 있으니, 해당 규칙을 \"min-height: 100dvh\"로 대체하고 호환성을 위해 폴백으로\n\"min-height: 100vh\" (또는 필요 시 기존 \"height: 100vh\")를 순차적으로 선언하여 적용하세요; 즉, 찾을 식별자\n\"height: 100vh\"를 교체하고 새로운 min-height 규칙을 해당 스타일 블록(또는 관련 클래스/컴포넌트 스타일)에 추가하세요.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/components/cardPreview/CardPreview.tsx`:\n- Line 24: The map currently calls EachCardNumber as a plain function\n(cardNumber.map((number, index) => EachCardNumber(number, index))) which\nprevents passing a React key and blurs component intent; change the map to JSX\nsyntax: cardNumber.map((number, index) => <EachCardNumber key={index}\nnumber={number} index={index} />) and update the EachCardNumber\ncomponent/signature to accept props (e.g., function EachCardNumber({ number,\nindex }) or a React.FC with props number and index) so it renders correctly as a\ncomponent and receives number and index via props.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🪄 Autofix (Beta)</summary>\n\nFix all unresolved CodeRabbit comments on this PR:\n\n- [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\": \"4b0d0e0a-96d7-4f10-b296-3a18ea78f0b9\"} --> Push a commit to this branch (recommended)\n- [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\": \"ff5b1114-7d8c-49e6-8ac1-43f82af23a33\"} --> Create a new PR with the fixes\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>ℹ️ Review info</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: Organization UI\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Pro\n\n**Run ID**: `a7a44c57-5675-4171-a2b1-c92bbb46c5fc`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between 8d4c2c73f7cce87ffaae55245ae1cfd10228981d and fc02d45d960f053f4d0a95beae78087fab32abef.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⛔ Files ignored due to path filters (7)</summary>\n\n* `my-app/package-lock.json` is excluded by `!**/package-lock.json`\n* `my-app/public/favicon.svg` is excluded by `!**/*.svg`\n* `my-app/public/icons.svg` is excluded by `!**/*.svg`\n* `my-app/src/assets/MaskingImg.png` is excluded by `!**/*.png`\n* `my-app/src/assets/Mastercard.png` is excluded by `!**/*.png`\n* `my-app/src/assets/Visa.png` is excluded by `!**/*.png`\n* `package-lock.json` is excluded by `!**/package-lock.json`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (40)</summary>\n\n* `README.md`\n* `my-app/.eslintrc.cjs`\n* `my-app/.gitignore`\n* `my-app/.prettierrc`\n* `my-app/.storybook/main.ts`\n* `my-app/.storybook/preview.ts`\n* `my-app/README.md`\n* `my-app/eslint.config.js`\n* `my-app/index.html`\n