stem consistency and migration guides indicate alignment is required to avoid incompatibilities, especially with ESM-only changes in v10 and other breaking updates.\n\nCitations:\n\n- 1: https://storybook.js.org/docs/releases/migration-guide\n- 2: https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/releases/tag/v10.3.6\n- 3: https://npmjs.com/package/storybook?activeTab=versions\n- 4: https://github.com/storybookjs/test-runner/issues/591\n- 5: https://storybook.js.org/docs/10/addons/addon-migration-guide\n- 6: https://github.com/storybookjs/test-runner/commit/9edfe7a7a8ce06c3cb9e64396cc7de6a7ca88fc2\n- 7: https://storybook.js.org/blog/storybook-10/\n- 8: https://storybook.js.org/docs/writing-tests/interaction-testing\n- 9: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@storybook/test-runner?activeTab=dependencies\n- 10: https://storybook.js.org/docs/10/releases\n- 11: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@storybook/test\n- 12: https://github.com/storybookjs/test-runner\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**@storybook/test를 버전 10.3.5로 업그레이드하거나 제거하세요.**\n\n`@storybook/test`는 현재 `8.6.15`이지만 나머지 Storybook 패키지들은 모두 `10.3.5`입니다. 공식 문서에 따르면 Storybook 10.x에서는 모든 `@storybook/*` 패키지가 동일한 메이저 버전으로 정렬되어야 하며, `8.6.15`와 `10.3.5`를 혼용하는 것은 지원되지 않습니다. 추가로 코드베이스에서 `@storybook/test`의 실제 사용처를 찾을 수 없으므로, 필요하지 않다면 의존성에서 제거하는 것이 안전합니다.\n\n- 해결 방법: `@storybook/test`를 `^10.3.5`로 업그레이드하거나, 미사용 패키지라면 `package.json`에서 제거\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@my-app/package.json` around lines 24 - 31, The dependency `@storybook/test` is\npinned to 8.6.15 while all other `@storybook/`* packages are 10.3.5; update\npackage.json by either changing the `@storybook/test` entry to \"^10.3.5\" to align\nmajor versions or remove the `@storybook/test` dependency entirely if it's unused\n(search for imports/usages of \"@storybook/test\" in the codebase first); after\nchanging package.json run your package manager install and run tests/build 